        <body>
            <div xml:id="d589-a2">

                <pb facs="0553" n="479" sameAs="frus:frus1865p2/pg479"/>

                <head>No. 2.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>FERROL</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-04"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 4,
                    1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To the United States Ambassador:</hi></p>
                <p>At this moment the armor-clad confederate brig Stonewall, of 300 horse-power, 3
                    guns, Commander V. G. Page, crew 79, from Copenhagen and Corunna, bound for
                    America, has arrived, I ask prompt instructions.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FERNANDEZ.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
